{"title": "Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack", "pageid": 22733, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp/300px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp, /w/images/f/f6/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp/300px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</b> is a passive feature granted the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Weapon Master\">Great Weapon Master</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. It allows a character to use a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a> to make an additional melee attack during the same turn they land a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> or kill a creature with a melee weapon.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you land a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> or kill a target with a melee weapon attack, you can make another melee weapon attack as a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> that turn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack\"> Condition: Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(Condition)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(Condition)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (Condition)\">Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can make a melee attack as a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Weapon Master\">Great Weapon Master</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baretha\" title=\"Baretha\">Baretha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Whitburn_Servant\" title=\"Dead Whitburn Servant\">Dead Whitburn Servant</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ebber\" title=\"Ebber\">Ebber</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fry\" title=\"Fry\">Fry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Goodge\" title=\"Goodge\">Goodge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gravedigger_Karcen\" title=\"Gravedigger Karcen\">Gravedigger Karcen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gyordi\" title=\"Gyordi\">Gyordi</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Ague\" title=\"Lady Ague\">Lady Ague</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Quinsy\" title=\"Lady Quinsy\">Lady Quinsy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Falgor\" title=\"Marcus Falgor\">Marcus Falgor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Matthew\" title=\"Matthew\">Matthew</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Preyn\" title=\"Preyn\">Preyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Watcher_Guardian\" title=\"Watcher Guardian\">Watcher Guardian</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive does not require a <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-Handed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Versatile\" title=\"Versatile\">Versatile</a> weapon, and allows for a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> attack with any melee weapon.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_All_In\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: All In\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/40px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: All In\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_All_In\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: All In\">Great Weapon Master: All In</a> does not need to be enabled for this passive to trigger.</li>\n<li>Defeating a creature with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Non-Lethal Damage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\">Non-Lethal Damage</a> also triggers this passive.</li>\n<li>Can be triggered multiple times in one turn, but cannot be triggered by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(attack)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (attack)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/40px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(attack)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (attack)\">Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</a>.</li>\n<li>Reducing a creature protected by <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\">Death Ward</a> to 0 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a> without killing it <b>does</b> grant Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195440\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1837/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21363/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9737/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 880/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1131734/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.000      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   57.000      1 -total\n 20.86%   11.891      1 Template:Condition\n 15.47%    8.818      5 Template:Icon_text\n 15.08%    8.596      2 Template:R\n 14.66%    8.356      4 Template:Icon_link\n 11.86%    6.763     12 Template:Trim\n 11.03%    6.288      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.91%    6.219      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 10.30%    5.870      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22733-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195440 and revision id 388854. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}